00:01:49.410 --> 00:01:50.440
all across the world.

00:01:50.440 --> 00:01:52.866
Again, makes it more than a
single dedicated server or VM

00:01:52.866 --> 00:01:53.740
could ever deal with.

00:01:58.007 --> 00:02:00.090
